  "text": "Planning Document: docs/dcps/INNERWEST/Marrickville/Marrickville DCP 2011 - 9 37 King Street and Enmore Road Commercial Precinct.pdf\n\nClause 9.37.1 - heritage (development_control): Heritage Items and Contributory buildings must be retained and conserved.\n\nClause 9.37.2 - heritage (development_control): To protect the identified H eritage Item s within the precinct.\n\nClause 9.37.2 - heritage (development_control): To protect the identified values of the King Street and Enmore Road  Heritage Conservation Area .\n\nClause 9.37.2 - setback (development_control): To ensure that buil dings provide strong definition to the street through retention of the existing nil  building setbacks.\n\nClause 9.37.2 - heritage (development_control): To retain, as a minimum, the front portion of contributory buildings where they are contributory to the heritage conservation area (HCA) and/or streetsca pe.\n\nClause 9.37.2 - heritage (development_control): Where required, t o protect, pr eserve and enhance the existing character of the streetscape, where only compatible development is permitted.\n\nClause 9.37.2 - height_limit (development_control): existing predominantly traditional two storey commercial st reetscape\n\nClause 9.37.2 - other (development_control): To ensure  that there are active commercial fronts to new buildings facing onto streets to create a vibrant and safe streetscape.\n\n",
